WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.680
Sinceramente no recordaba esto.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.400
And hearing about our parents’

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:10.720
friendship is news to me.

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.480
I always pictured them as

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:15.160
sworn enemies.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.520
Mason?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:22.560
No.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:25.480
Caring Mason is long gone, grandpa.

00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:26.520
Sorry, I need to take this.

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.520
That's important.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.400
I'll be right back.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.240
Time for your shot.

00:00:44.840 --> 00:00:47.640
I haven't seen you before.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.800
The previous shift ended.

00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:51.600
I'm taking over now.

00:00:58.840 --> 00:01:01.440
Oh! Dios mio!

00:01:01.440 --> 00:01:02.760
Without a mask

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.080
you’re even more beautiful

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.920
than in my dreams, lady.

00:01:05.920 --> 00:01:06.360
Thank you.

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.240
But it's not the right time for jokes.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:09.320
Okay?

00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:10.960
Let's get down to business.

00:01:10.960 --> 00:01:11.920
What happened?

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:17.440
Well, I'm calling to say that... Um...

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:19.400
I got a better offer. So...

00:01:19.400 --> 00:01:21.160
Don't expect the shipment. Okay?

00:01:21.160 --> 00:01:23.080
What?

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:24.840
Wait. Are you...

00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:26.120
You're serious now?
